[{"id":162631438,"discussion_id":"29ebfb927d5e18f338e6db7ab9f411e05db43143","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| pooling | ✅ [*fanqirui*](https://gitcode.com/fanqirui), [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (2/2) | ✅ [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n","created_at":"2026-02-09T14:37:39+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-10T16:22:28+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162631449,"discussion_id":"88efbf635026d205c62a282f2b3ef18b19ff70d1","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n liuchuangdev, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-02-09T14:37:42+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-09T14:37:42+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162631455,"discussion_id":"b5dc8ce29f14adfed7381e2e9a00c30938523089","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-09T14:37:44+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-09T14:37:44+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162631757,"discussion_id":"d0541c5a193a1e18e51de8ddac1bfd08ee454372","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n在SIMT架构的MaxPool梯度计算内核中，存在一个内存一致性问题。具体表现为，在设置完计算参数后、访问全局内存地址前，后续的访存和计算指令可能无法获取到正确的参数数据，这可能导致内核执行结果错误。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n为解决上述问题，在`MaxPoolGradWithArgmaxV3Simt::Process`函数中，于设置完所有SIMT计算参数（如magicHW、shiftHW等）之后，但在获取全局内存地址指针并调用SIMT向量函数之前，插入一条`DataSyncBarrier<MemDsbT::UB>()`指令。该指令确保所有对统一缓冲区（UB）中参数`SimtParam`的写入操作对后续指令可见，从而保障内核执行的正确性。此修改属于内核实现层面的正确性修复，不涉及外部接口或安全风险。","created_at":"2026-02-09T14:39:11+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-09T14:39:11+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162635948,"discussion_id":"d848272f72826f14fc8643b5e35b5c617bbd1600","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-02-09T14:58:25+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-09T14:58:25+08:00","user":{"id":"68ccc0773ea9c3041816049d","login":"liuchuangdev","object_id":"68ccc0773ea9c3041816049d","name":"liuchuangdev","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liuchuangdev"},"comment_type":"pr_